can/should go away.

Further according to my private database of unfunctional email addresses
the 3 sony related addresses of Frank Rowand don't work any more, I still
kept them on Cc: just in case, but you might want to drop them if you
reply to this mail with a topic that doesn't directly affect him.
(Hint to Frank: Revert these UIDs.)

Further²: Daniel Lezcano's 2nd UID 

	Daniel Lezcano <daniel.lezcano@@free.fr>

is broken. I think it needs s/@@/@/; that's also what I assumed here for
Cc:.

